# 统一换行：仓库内文本用 LF，工作区按平台 checkout；.bat / .cmd 保持 CRLF（cmd 友好）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制（不参与 diff / 不尝试合并）
*.tgz binary
*.tar binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.asar binary
